#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/shares/share.py:337
msgid "A name beginning with the character + will be exclusively considered as a UNIX group, a name beginning with the character & will be exclusively considered as a NIS net-group."
msgstr "以字元 + 開頭的名稱將僅視為 UNIX 群組，以字元 & 開頭的名稱將僅視為 NIS net-group。"

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/shares/share.py:336
msgid "A name beginning with the character @ will first be interpreted as a NIS net-group. Should no NIS net-group of this name be found, the name will be considered as a UNIX group."
msgstr "以字元 @ 開頭的名稱會先被解讀為 NIS net-group。若找不到此名稱的 NIS net-group，則該名稱會被視為 UNIX 群組。"

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/shares/share.py:338
msgid "A name beginning with the characters +&, will first be interpreted as a UNIX group. Should no UNIX group of this name be found, the name will be considered as a NIS net-group. The characters &+ as the beginning of a name correspond to the character @."
msgstr "以字元 +& 開頭的名稱會先被解讀為 UNIX 群組。若找不到此名稱的 UNIX 群組，則該名稱會被視為 NIS net-group。以字元 &+ 開頭的名稱等同於字元 @。"

